.TH KBUDS 1 "November 2026" "kbuds 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kbuds \- settings for Google Pixel Buds
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kbuds
.RI [ Qt\ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kbuds
shows the battery of Google Pixel Buds Pro, Pro 2 and 2a and lets you change
noise control, multipoint and "PC only" (exclusive) mode. It also reports and
fixes audio-stream problems (Opus dual mono, headset-profile fallback).
.PP
It is a client of the
.BR kbudsd
daemon (D-Bus name io.github.kbuds.Daemon on the session bus), which it starts
through D-Bus activation when needed. It never talks to Bluetooth itself.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B QT_QUICK_CONTROLS_STYLE
Overrides the default Material style (as does the
.B \-style
option), e.g. org.kde.desktop for the Plasma look.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kbudsctl (1)
